      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The bounty hunter's last action was a successful Athletics check to Disarm or Trip a creature using a rope dart</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The bounty hunter makes a rope dart Strike against the tripped creature, using the same multiple attack penalty as the triggering Disarm or Trip attempt. The bounty hunter then Interacts to retrieve the rope dart.</p>",
