    {
      "name": "Quick-Release Snare",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The bounty hunter draws a snare from their bag and tosses it at a creature within 20 feet. The target takes (4d8+18) Piercing Damage damage (Basic DC 26 Reflex Saving Throw save) and is Off-Guard until the end of the bounty hunter's next turn. The bounty hunter can't use this ability again for 1 minute.</p>",
